// Sum of the winning labeled hammings among the kept pairs.
// No pair returns nothing. A winning hamming of zero adds nothing.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hsum ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hsum rank

IMPULSE hsum 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hsum" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
